  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SOYEK7i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fhaven\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WQb5y3A.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"134\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">《Create：Haven Qualities》是《Create》（机械动力 v0.5.1d）的一个插件，为游戏添加了更多方块、物品和配方，以提升《Create》的品质。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif;color:#396\">1.0.1+ 版本现已支持封装轴、齿轮、大齿轮和管道。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">查看展示与配方，了解本模组包含的内容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欢迎在评论区留言建议与讨论，但任何反馈、问题、错误或崩溃报告</span><strong style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">必须</strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过 Issues 页面提交。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#333;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><em>本模组仍在开发中。</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/duAiK2H.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"63\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7SHEy62xxn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" width=\"63\" height=\"62\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">1.0.1 版本展示：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/snoYVez8pX8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"530\" width=\"530\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">展示：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gMNDtDH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YPSvTgZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/P6LVUk3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G5wWbhi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MUr3ydk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/594qLXB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qiehl3d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y2XXW23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JJ5tUzT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1jFjLqI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/z0rBnxC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>配方：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>外壳：</strong>&nbsp;(手动右键使用物品同样有效)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j3CzALi.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"156\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">切石机：</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有外壳均可放入切石机以获取对应变体。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>破碎机配方：</strong></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">烈焰粉 &gt; 4x 烈焰尘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">煤炭 &gt; 4x 煤尘&nbsp; <em>（是的，这与黑色染料配方冲突，请使用磨粉机制作染料）</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">钻石 &gt; 4x 钻石尘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">金锭 &gt; 4x 金尘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">铁锭 &gt; 4x 铁尘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">青金石 &gt; 4x 青金石尘 <em>（是的，这与蓝色染料配方冲突，请使用磨粉机制作染料）</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">下界合金碎片 &gt; 4x 下界合金尘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">石英 &gt; 4x 石英尘</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>注：这些尘类物品仅用于制作外壳，请勿与其他类型的尘混淆。</strong></span></em></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><br>使用破碎机回收物品的配方：</strong></span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">铜潜水靴</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">铜潜水头盔&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">下界合金护甲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">钻石护甲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">金护甲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">铁护甲&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">皮革护甲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">下界合金工具与武器&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">钻石工具与武器&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">金工具与武器&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">铁工具与武器&nbsp;(不含剪刀与盾牌)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">桶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">属性过滤器&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">列表过滤器&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">书&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">附魔书&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">黄铜板&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">铜板&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">金板&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">铁板&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">电子管&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">抛光玫瑰石英&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">烈焰燃烧室&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">酿造台&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">铜块&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">苦力怕头颅&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">深板岩&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">龙首&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">空的烈焰燃烧室&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">附魔台&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">镶金黑石&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">脚手架&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">骷髅头颅&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">凋灵骷髅头颅&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">僵尸头颅&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">已知冲突：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-recycle-everything\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Recycle Everything</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/7SHEy62xxn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nt3vpL1.png\" width=\"1000\" height=\"179\"></a></span></p>",
